<span data-type="" itemprop="" class="os-text">Solve Proportions and their Applications</span>
</h2><div data-type="abstract" class="ui-has-child-title"><header><h3 data-type="title">Learning Objectives</h3></header><section><p id="para-00001">By the end of this section, you will be able to:</p><ul id="list-00001">
<li>Use the definition of proportion</li>
<li>Solve proportions</li>
<li>Solve applications using proportions</li>
<li>Write percent equations as proportions</li>
<li>Translate and solve percent proportions</li>
</ul></section></div>

