<div data-type="exercise" id="fs-id1708270" class="unnumbered"><header></header><section><div data-type="problem" id="fs-id1166494585692"><div class="os-problem-container">
<p id="fs-id1287243">Write each sentence as a proportion:

</p><ol id="eip-id1168468553410" type="1" class="circled"><li><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mn>3</mn></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math> is to <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>7</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> as <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>15</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> is to <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></li>

<li><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mn>5</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mn>5</mn></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math> hits in <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>8</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> at bats is the same as <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>30</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> hits in <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>48</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> at-bats.</li>

<li><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mrow><mtext>$1.50</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mrow><mtext>$1.50</mtext></mrow></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math> for <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>6</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> ounces is equivalent to <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mtext>$2.25</mtext></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mtext>$2.25</mtext></annotation-xml></semantics></math> for <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>9</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> ounces.</li></ol></div></div>
