<div class="os-note-body">
<div data-type="exercise" id="fs-id1476998" class="unnumbered os-hasSolution"><header></header><section>
<div data-type="problem" id="fs-id1543802"><div class="os-problem-container">
<p id="fs-id1166492788601">Write each sentence as a proportion:

</p><ol id="eip-id1168467325322" type="1" class="circled"><li><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mn>5</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> is to <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>9</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> as <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>20</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> is to <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>.</mo></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>36</mn><mo>.</mo></annotation-xml></semantics></math></li>

<li><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mn>7</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> hits in <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>11</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> at-bats is the same as <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>28</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> hits in <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>44</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>44</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> at-bats.</li>

<li><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mtext>$2.50</mtext></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mspace width="0.2em"></mspace><mtext>$2.50</mtext></annotation-xml></semantics></math> for <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>8</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> ounces is equivalent to <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mtext>$3.75</mtext></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mtext>$3.75</mtext></annotation-xml></semantics></math> for <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>12</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math> ounces.</li>
</ol></div></div>

