  <tbody>

<tr> <td colspan="2">
</td><td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1168468337952" data-alt="A mathematical equation is displayed, showing a fraction on the left side, x over 63, which is equal to the fraction 4 over 7 on the right side."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of A mathematical equation is displayed, showing a fraction on the left side, x over 63, which is equal to the fraction 4 over 7 on the right side." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/a48dab812816d72b64da9b209751c6e5934ba31d" data-media-type="image/jpeg" alt="A mathematical equation is displayed, showing a fraction on the left side, x over 63, which is equal to the fraction 4 over 7 on the right side." width="142" height="47" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/a48dab812816d72b64da9b209751c6e5934ba31d"></button> </span></td>
</tr>

 <tr>
   <td colspan="2"> To isolate <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mi>x</mi></annotation-xml></semantics></math>, multiply both sides by the LCD, 63. </td>
   <td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1168467155871" data-alt="A mathematical equation shows 63 multiplied by the fraction x over 63, which equals 63 multiplied by the fraction 4 over 7. The number 63 is highlighted in red on both sides of the equation."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of A mathematical equation shows 63 multiplied by the fraction x over 63, which equals 63 multiplied by the fraction 4 over 7. The number 63 is highlighted in red on both sides of the equation." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/7da270b79957d0706b095713bcf5dd9bc4f40d29" data-media-type="image/jpeg" alt="A mathematical equation shows 63 multiplied by the fraction x over 63, which equals 63 multiplied by the fraction 4 over 7. The number 63 is highlighted in red on both sides of the equation." width="142" height="36" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/7da270b79957d0706b095713bcf5dd9bc4f40d29"></button> </span></td>
