 <td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1168467599001" data-alt="A mathematical equation displays 'x = 36' in a black serif font on a plain white background, centered within the frame."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of A mathematical equation displays 'x = 36' in a black serif font on a plain white background, centered within the frame." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/522292e729432c801a128ca9f4a8d75c66470afe" data-media-type="image/jpeg" alt="A mathematical equation displays 'x = 36' in a black serif font on a plain white background, centered within the frame." width="142" height="19" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/522292e729432c801a128ca9f4a8d75c66470afe"></button> </span></td>
