 <tr>
 <td>Show common factors. </td>
 <td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1168468350523" data-alt="A mathematical expression asks if the fraction (4 times 9) divided by (7 times 9) is equal to 4/7. This illustrates the principle of simplifying fractions by canceling common factors."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of A mathematical expression asks if the fraction (4 times 9) divided by (7 times 9) is equal to 4/7. This illustrates the principle of simplifying fractions by canceling common factors." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/4010a781440b3f4bc446b53a307936fd2a5cb3f8" data-media-type="image/jpeg" alt="A mathematical expression asks if the fraction (4 times 9) divided by (7 times 9) is equal to 4/7. This illustrates the principle of simplifying fractions by canceling common factors." width="142" height="42" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/4010a781440b3f4bc446b53a307936fd2a5cb3f8"></button> </span></td>
 <td>
 </td></tr>

