<div class="os-note-body">
<div data-type="exercise" id="fs-id1166498435818" class="unnumbered os-hasSolution"><header></header><section>
<div data-type="problem" id="fs-id1435915"><div class="os-problem-container">
<p id="fs-id1425486">Solve the proportion: <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>96</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>96</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span></p>
