</div></section></div>
<p id="fs-id1166491401870">When the variable is in a denominator, we’ll use the fact that the <span data-type="term" class="no-emphasis" id="term-00004" group-by="c">cross products</span> of a proportion are equal to solve the proportions. </p><p id="eip-247">We can find the cross products of the proportion and then set them equal. Then we solve the resulting equation using our familiar techniques.</p><div data-type="example" id="fs-id1166497375779" class="ui-has-child-title"><header><h3 class="os-title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Example </span>
  <span class="os-number">6.43</span>
  <span class="os-divider"> </span>
</h3></header><section>
<div class="body">
<div data-type="exercise" id="fs-id1691862" class="unnumbered"><header></header><section><div data-type="problem" id="fs-id1445776"><div class="os-problem-container">
<p id="fs-id1251260">Solve: <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>144</mn></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>144</mn></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span></p>
</div></div>
<details data-type="solution" id="fs-id1356436" aria-label="Show/Hide Solution">
