<div data-type="example" id="fs-id1359323" class="ui-has-child-title"><header><h3 class="os-title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Example </span>
  <span class="os-number">6.53</span>
  <span class="os-divider"> </span>
</h3></header><section>
<div class="body">
<div data-type="exercise" id="fs-id1166490830853" class="unnumbered"><header></header><section><div data-type="problem" id="fs-id1479355"><div class="os-problem-container">
<p id="fs-id1811026">Translate and solve: <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mtext>6.5%</mtext></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mtext>6.5%</mtext></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> of what number is <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>$1.56</mtext><mo>?</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mtext>$1.56</mtext><mo>?</mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span></p>
</div></div>
<details data-type="solution" id="fs-id1525196" aria-label="Show/Hide Solution">
        <summary class="btn-link ui-toggle" title="Show/Hide Solution" data-content="Show/Hide Solution"></summary>
        <section class="ui-body" role="alert"><h4 data-type="solution-title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Solution</span>
</h4>
<div class="os-solution-container">
<div class="os-table os-unstyled-container" id="eip-id1166127046328"><table data-id="eip-id1166127046328" class="unnumbered unstyled" data-summary="Step-by-step guide demonstrating how to solve a percentage problem using proportions, illustrating the procedure and mathematical solution for 6.5% of $24." data-label="" role="presentation">
  <tbody>
  <tr>
    <td>Identify the parts of the percent proportion.</td>
    <td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1166123083364" data-alt="A percentage problem breaking down '6.5% of what number is $1.56?' into its components: percent, base, and amount."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of A percentage problem breaking down '6.5% of what number is $1.56?' into its components: percent, base, and amount." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/5b8d832a55da12b33d837465179362d65f183cbe" data-media-type="image/png" alt="A percentage problem breaking down '6.5% of what number is $1.56?' into its components: percent, base, and amount." width="455" height="63" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/5b8d832a55da12b33d837465179362d65f183cbe"></button></span></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Restate as a proportion.</td>

    <td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1166123514210" data-alt="$1.56 out of what number is the same as 6.5 out of 100?"><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of $1.56 out of what number is the same as 6.5 out of 100?" class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/353b305f4fabca02059bea2531e2664789b15217" data-media-type="image/png" alt="$1.56 out of what number is the same as 6.5 out of 100?" width="455" height="23" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/353b305f4fabca02059bea2531e2664789b15217"></button></span></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
<td>Set up the proportion. Let<math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo></annotation-xml></semantics></math> number.</td>
<td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1168465986065" data-alt="A mathematical equation shows a proportion: 1.56 divided by n is equal to 6.5 divided by 100."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of A mathematical equation shows a proportion: 1.56 divided by n is equal to 6.5 divided by 100." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/8cd0bd4af251a19926af2029bc2c3014d76aade0" data-media-type="image/jpeg" alt="A mathematical equation shows a proportion: 1.56 divided by n is equal to 6.5 divided by 100." width="142" height="38" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/8cd0bd4af251a19926af2029bc2c3014d76aade0"></button></span></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>Find the cross products and set them equal. </td>
<td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1168469489028" data-alt="A mathematical equation is displayed, reading 100 multiplied by 1.56 equals 'n' multiplied by 6.5."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of A mathematical equation is displayed, reading 100 multiplied by 1.56 equals 'n' multiplied by 6.5." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/380ad47dcb3d54fd93d3929c431a321f63cd388f" data-media-type="image/jpeg" alt="A mathematical equation is displayed, reading 100 multiplied by 1.56 equals 'n' multiplied by 6.5." width="142" height="21" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/380ad47dcb3d54fd93d3929c431a321f63cd388f"></button></span></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>Simplify.</td>
<td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1168469489045" data-alt="An image displays the mathematical equation '156 = 6.5n' on a white background. The numbers and symbols are rendered in a clear, dark font."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of An image displays the mathematical equation '156 = 6.5n' on a white background. The numbers and symbols are rendered in a clear, dark font." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/5d864f8cc8f7cb831f15360c372eff13e9880d67" data-media-type="image/jpeg" alt="An image displays the mathematical equation '156 = 6.5n' on a white background. The numbers and symbols are rendered in a clear, dark font." width="142" height="18" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/5d864f8cc8f7cb831f15360c372eff13e9880d67"></button></span></td>
</tr>

 <tr>
   <td>Divide both sides by 6.5 to isolate the variable.</td>
   <td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1168469651890" data-alt="An equation showing 156 divided by 6.5 equals 6.5n divided by 6.5, illustrating a step in solving for 'n'."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of An equation showing 156 divided by 6.5 equals 6.5n divided by 6.5, illustrating a step in solving for 'n'." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/7c6cac82d25f04277d83c45134a85cb4915d165b" data-media-type="image/jpeg" alt="An equation showing 156 divided by 6.5 equals 6.5n divided by 6.5, illustrating a step in solving for 'n'." width="142" height="39" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/7c6cac82d25f04277d83c45134a85cb4915d165b"></button></span></td>
 </tr>

<tr>
<td>Simplify.</td>
<td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1168469781785" data-alt="A mathematical equation displays '24 = n' in a black font against a white background."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of A mathematical equation displays '24 = n' in a black font against a white background." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/00b0f4ff0138737c2c7dcd8355497e212bd8b86c" data-media-type="image/jpeg" alt="A mathematical equation displays '24 = n' in a black font against a white background." width="142" height="19" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/00b0f4ff0138737c2c7dcd8355497e212bd8b86c"></button></span></td>
</tr>

<tr>
 <td>Check if the answer is reasonable. </td>
<td>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td> Yes. 6.5% is a small amount and $1.56 is much less than $24.</td>
<td>
</td></tr>
 <tr>
 <td>Write a complete sentence that answers the question.</td>
 <td>6.5% of $24 is $1.56.</td>
 </tr>

</tbody>
</table></div></div>
</section>
      </details>
</section></div></div></section></div>
