</h3></header><section>
<div class="body">
<div data-type="exercise" id="fs-id1257619" class="unnumbered"><header></header><section><div data-type="problem" id="fs-id1241946"><div class="os-problem-container">
<p id="fs-id1305046">Translate and solve using proportions: What percent of <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>72</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> is <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>?</mo></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>9</mn><mo>?</mo></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span></p>
</div></div>
<details data-type="solution" id="fs-id1445168" aria-label="Show/Hide Solution">
        <summary class="btn-link ui-toggle" title="Show/Hide Solution" data-content="Show/Hide Solution"></summary>
        <section class="ui-body" role="alert"><h4 data-type="solution-title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Solution</span>
</h4>
<div class="os-solution-container">
<div class="os-table os-unstyled-container" id="eip-id1171789006462"><table data-id="eip-id1171789006462" class="unnumbered unstyled" data-summary="A step-by-step guide demonstrating how to solve for a percentage in a proportion problem." data-label="" role="presentation">
  <tbody>
  <tr>
    <td>Identify the parts of the percent proportion.</td>
    <td><span data-type="media" id="eip-id1171793496328" data-alt="A percentage problem asks, 'What percent of 72 is 9?' It labels 'What percent' as 'percent', '72' as 'base', and '9' as 'amount', with 'of' highlighted in red to show its role."><button type="button" aria-label="Click to enlarge image of A percentage problem asks, 'What percent of 72 is 9?' It labels 'What percent' as 'percent', '72' as 'base', and '9' as 'amount', with 'of' highlighted in red to show its role." class="image-button-wrapper"><img src="/apps/image-cdn/v1/f=webp/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/7a6e7e344b025111cd5924021b2c251848d840d0" data-media-type="image/png" alt="A percentage problem asks, 'What percent of 72 is 9?' It labels 'What percent' as 'percent', '72' as 'base', and '9' as 'amount', with 'of' highlighted in red to show its role." width="418" height="61" loading="lazy" data-original-src="/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/7a6e7e344b025111cd5924021b2c251848d840d0"></button></span></td>
  </tr>
