<div class="os-problem-container">
<p id="fs-id1224443">Pediatricians prescribe <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>5</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> milliliters (ml) of acetaminophen for every <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>25</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> pounds of a child’s weight. How many milliliters of acetaminophen will the doctor prescribe for Jocelyn, who weighs <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>45</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> pounds?</p>
